<title>SWEDEN: Swedish producer prices rise 0.1 pct in Sept.</title>
<headline>Swedish producer prices rise 0.1 pct in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish producer prices rose 0.1 percent in September, Statistics Sweden said on Friday.</p>
<p> (Percentage change)	     SEPT 96     12 MO TO DATE</p>
<p> Export prices		     +0.2	    -8.4</p>
<p> Import prices		     +1.1	    -4.6</p>
<p> Producer prices		   +0.1	    -5.0</p>
<p>Note - The market had expected PPI to fall by 0.1 percent, according to a Reuter survey.</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
</text>
